  "bodyHash": "UUv6NCOZCGM=",
  "content": "<h4><span style=\"color:#333;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/419/356/capa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"340\"><br></span></h4><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組為 Minecraft 加入了著名的密集礦石，新增的密集版本會比普通礦石多掉落 3 個礦物。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如密集紅石礦、密集石英礦、密集青金石礦、密集地獄金礦等，每種都會掉落 12 個對應礦物。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">基本上，這個模組加入了礦石方塊的「密集」版本，掉落物品數量是普通礦石的 3 倍。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這些礦石支援<strong>絲綢之觸</strong>和<strong>幸運</strong>附魔！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模組僅新增 Minecraft 礦石的密集版本。</span></strong></p><h4 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h4><h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'arial black', sans-serif\">1.16.x 版本資訊：</span></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h4><div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/145/2021-02-28_02.png\" width=\"890\" height=\"500\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;本模組為 Minecraft 加入了著名的密集礦石，新增的密集版本會比普通礦石多掉落 3 個礦物。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如密集紅石礦、密集石英礦、密集青金石礦、密集地獄金礦等，每種都會掉落 12 個對應礦物。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">基本上，這個模組加入了礦石方塊的「密集」版本，掉落物品數量是普通礦石的 3 倍。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">這些礦石支援<strong>絲綢之觸</strong>和<strong>幸運</strong>附魔！</span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>本模組僅新增 Minecraft 礦石的密集版本。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集礦石列表：</strong></span></h5>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集煤礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集鐵礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集金礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集紅石礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集青金石礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集鑽石礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集綠寶石礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集石英礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集地獄金礦；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">密集遠古殘骸。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集煤礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：1 - 125 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：3 倍煤炭。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/606/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集鐵礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：5 - 40 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：3 倍鐵礦。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/607/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集金礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：1 - 32 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：3 倍金礦。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/608/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集紅石礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：1 - 16 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：12 倍紅石。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/609/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集青金石礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：1 - 31 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：12 倍青金石。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/610/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集鑽石礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生成高度 (y)：1 - 16 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：3 倍鑽石。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/611/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"390\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集綠寶石礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>生態域：極限山丘和山地 /&nbsp;</em><em>生成高度 (y)：4 - 32 / 掉落：3 倍綠寶石。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/612/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"380\" height=\"380\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集石英礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>僅地獄 /&nbsp;</em><em>生成高度 (y)：10 -</em>&nbsp;117 /&nbsp;<em>掉落：12 倍石英。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/613/2021-02-28_14.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"350\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集地獄金礦：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>僅地獄 / 生成高度 (y)：10 - 117 / 掉落：12 倍金粒。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/614/2021-02-28_15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"390\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>密集遠古殘骸：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em>僅地獄 /&nbsp;</em><em>生成高度 (y)：8 - 28 /&nbsp;</em><em>掉落：4 倍地獄合金碎片。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/615/ancient_debris_je1_be1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;註：&nbsp;<span>密集遠古殘骸的材質比預設材質稍暗。</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><em>地獄維度中的密集地獄金礦！</em></strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/344/144/captura-de-tela-45.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1349\" height=\"758\"></em></span></p>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong><em>歡迎將本模組加入您的模組包中！</em></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p>",
